  author = {Pengfei Zhu and Longyin Wen and Dawei Du and Xiao Bian and Haibin Ling and Qinghua Hu and Qinqin Nie and Hao Cheng and Chenfeng Liu and Xiaoyu Liu and Wenya Ma and Haotian Wu and Lianjie Wang and Arne Schumann and Chase Brown and Qian Chen and Chengzheng Li and Dongdong Li and Emmanouil Michail and Fan Zhang and Feng Ni and Feng Zhu and Guanghui Wang and Haipeng Zhang and Han Deng and Hao Liu and Haoran Wang and Heqian Qiu and Honggang Qi and Honghui Shi and Hongliang Li and Hongyu Xu and Hu Lin and Ioannis Kompatsiaris and Jian Cheng and Jianqiang Wang and Jianxiu Yang and Jingkai Zhou and Juanping Zhao and K. J. Joseph and Kaiwen Duan and Karthik Suresh and Bo Ke and Ke Wang and Konstantinos Avgerinakis and Lars Wilko Sommer and Lei Zhang and Li Yang and Lin Cheng and Lin Ma and Liyu Lu and Lu Ding and Minyu Huang and Naveen Kumar Vedurupaka and Nehal Mamgain and Nitin Bansal and Oliver Acatay and Panagiotis Giannakeris and Qian Wang and Qijie Zhao and Qingming Huang and Qiong Liu and Qishang Cheng and Qiuchen Sun and Robert Laganière and Sheng Jiang and Shengjin Wang and Shubo Wei and Siwei Wang and Stefanos Vrochidis and Sujuan Wang and Tiaojio Lee and Usman Sajid and Vineeth N. Balasubramanian and Wei Li and Wei Zhang and Weikun Wu and Wenchi Ma and Wenrui He and Wenzhe Yang and Xiaoyu Chen and Xin Sun and Xinbin Luo and Xintao Lian and Xiufang Li and Yangliu Kuai and Yali Li and Yi Luo and Yifan Zhang and Yiling Liu and Ying Li and Yong Wang and Yongtao Wang and Yuanwei Wu and Yue Fan and Yunchao Wei and Yuqin Zhang and Zexin Wang and Zhangyang Wang and Zhaoyue Xia and Zhen Cui and Zhenwei He and Zhipeng Deng and Zhiyao Guo and Zichen Song},
